{
 "encounter_id": "00702",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hello. It's probably nothing. I had COVID last month, and I feel run down, that's all."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long ago did you test positive? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Five weeks ago. I was in bed for a week, and since then I've just been flat. I used to go to the gym twice a week and I can't face it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Is it tiredness, or low energy, or something else?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Tired by mid-afternoon, mostly. Not sleepy exactly, just heavy."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever, cough or breathlessness left over?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fever, no cough, and my breathing's fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What are you taking at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ferrous sulphate, 200 mg once a day, since my iron was low last year. And vitamin D, 1000 units, every day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "None, no."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What conditions do you have?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Iron deficiency anaemia, last year. And migraines."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Just my tonsils out, when I was seven."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Gentle exercise has been part of your routine, so I understand why you feel the loss. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's the thing that keeps me sane. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Given your history, I wonder if your iron has dropped again after being ill. Heavy periods? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Not unusual for me, yes. A bit heavy lately. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That would make sense. I think this is most likely low iron again, on top of the after-effects of the virus."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Can that be checked? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes, I'd like to arrange a blood test, to check your iron stores, your blood count and your thyroid."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "When? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Today, if you can pop in to the nurse after this."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I can. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Meanwhile, get gentle exercise back slowly, a walk, not the gym, and eat iron-rich foods, with something with vitamin C."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Like spinach and orange juice? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Spot on. Don't take your iron tablet with tea or coffee, it blocks absorption."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ah, I do that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in two weeks, when the results are back."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Two weeks. Fine. ~"
  }
 ],
